# Bug with SDL2+curses
If curses is compiled (seems to be exactly a question of whether ncurses is 
linked in), drawing filled polygons or filled circles with sdl2-gfx crashes, 
with e.g.:
intricacy: SDLCallFailed {sdlExceptionCaller = "SDL.Primitive.fillPolygon", sdlFunction = "filledPolygonRGBA", sdlExceptionError = ""}

Very bizarre, some low-level bug beyond my ability to debug.
Tested with ghc-9.0 and 9.6.

